        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-06T14:42:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe that when doing a queue transfer from foreign/external to the graphics queue top is the correct thing to use. My understanding is that the src stages are about protecting work between same queue operations. So since this is being imported externally, there is no work on the current queue we need to block on. The same logic applies for why we can use Bottom on the export call. But maybe I am misunderstanding something about the spec.",
      "parentUuid": "74a7b1f4_156348d5",
      "revId": "c56c78c6a624f42b6f157c1561fa0c177eae007a",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
